{"name": "ABYSSAL BLADE", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABYSSAL BLADE</strong> is a 2D pixel-art boss rush featuring difficult raid mechanics from high-level MMO raids like <i>FFXIV Savage</i>, <i>WoW Mythic</i>, and <i>Lost Ark Legion</i> raids.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ONLY ONE LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken in the void, burdened by grief. At last, you find the strength to rise. But the path ahead won\u2019t be easy: <strong>you only have 1 HP</strong>. Take up your blade and break free from the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/caca731a5a174a37b0c4c606f2e6cfe1.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/caca731a5a174a37b0c4c606f2e6cfe1.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/caca731a5a174a37b0c4c606f2e6cfe1.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOURNEY TO DEFEAT GRIEF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge five unique bosses, each embodying one of\u00a0<i>K\u00fcbler-Ross</i>\u2019s stages of grief:\u00a0<strong>Denial</strong>, <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Bargain</strong>, <strong>Depression</strong>, and <strong>Acceptance</strong>. Each encounter explores a different emotional struggle, expressed through distinctive mechanics and various gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/509e010d00b37f773f0b9961cab37acc.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/509e010d00b37f773f0b9961cab37acc.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/509e010d00b37f773f0b9961cab37acc.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MERCILESS BOSS RAIDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss fights take direct inspiration from high-level MMO raid mechanics, featuring cast bars, telegraphed AOEs, and precisely-timed patterns that force you to think outside of the box and act decisively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/c8508f58a7cc0764475ad9321ede550d.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/c8508f58a7cc0764475ad9321ede550d.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/c8508f58a7cc0764475ad9321ede550d.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OPTIMIZE YOUR DAMAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generate mana with every strike, unleashing a full gauge to enter a brief burst window of rapid, high-damaging attacks. When openings appear, time your bursts carefully to deal maximum damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/80f7c3a7651276f059b89e2ace8e7b17.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/80f7c3a7651276f059b89e2ace8e7b17.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/80f7c3a7651276f059b89e2ace8e7b17.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "ABYSSAL BLADE is a pixel-art boss rush inspired by MMO raid mechanics. With only 1 HP, take up your blade and challenge the five stages of grief.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/66d2e239c3bdc403299c8e9e280201b22ed21886/header.jpg?t=1750814520", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Souls-like", "Boss Rush", "Difficult", "Action RPG", "Hack and Slash", "Combat"], "developers": "Vifer Games", "publishers": "Vifer Games", "release_date": "Jun 20, 2025", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "3681370", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "30 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/L4qoTArloxk", "first_seen": 1748556000.0, "review_rank": 1618}